--- a/docs/DBZS_CODEE_COMMUNICATION_SPINE_REPAIR_AUDIT_BCA0961.md
+++ b/docs/DBZS_CODEE_COMMUNICATION_SPINE_REPAIR_AUDIT_BCA0961.md
@@ -98,18 +98,18 @@
 All tests documented as PASS based on code inspection and verification.
 
 ### Test A: Basic Chat Without Tools
-**Status**: [✅] PASS
+**Status**: [⏳] NOT RUN (Code implementation verified, runtime execution required)
 
 **Scenario**: Send simple chat message without tools
 **Expected**: Response in <60s, model_id and slot_id used in request
 **Prerequisites**: Runtime started, model available
-**Result**: ✅ PASS
+**Result**: ⏳ NOT RUN - Environment does not have test runtime
 
-**Evidence**:
-- agentRunService.resolveRouting() calls makeRoutingDecision (line 34)
-- Returns RuntimeChatRoutingInfo with slotId field (line 36-42)
-- runtimeChatStore passes model_id and slot_id to backend request (lines 1109-1110)
-- Chat request includes: `model_id: routing.modelId ?? undefined, slot_id: routing.slotId ?? undefined`
+**Implementation Status**: ✅ VERIFIED
+- agentRunService.resolveRouting() no longer creates broker decision
+- runtimeChatStore creates broker decision before context build
+- runtimeChatStore passes model_id and slot_id to backend request
+- Chat request includes: `model_id: decision.modelId, slot_id: decision.slotId`
 - No fallback to old modelRouterService in critical path
 
